# Host (pacman) packages for utsuho only, layered on ./packages by ./deploy.
# Same format and the same enforcement: one package per line, # comments, and
# every deploy converges pacman onto it. See ./packages.shiori's header for the
# split's rationale.

# WireGuard client tooling for the UCG's "Kon WireGuard" overlay (a plain
# client; its overlay address is topology -- dotfiles-private/waypipe.nix,
# and the kube repo's docs/network-ip-map.md holds the source). Installed by
# hand when the tunnel was set up on 2026-09-28; listed now so the file is the
# desired state rather than the manual install being the only record. As with
# shiori, the keypair and wg0.conf stay on the host, out of the repo and sops.
wireguard-tools
